# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  公开可提交 (commit to GitHub):  README.md · docs/ · setup/ (已脱敏)
#  本地保密 (local only, 个人复用):  secrets/  —— 真实订阅/节点密码/安装包
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# secrets/ 内只提交说明文件，真实密钥一律忽略
secrets/*
!secrets/README.md

# 兜底：这些文件无论在哪都不提交 (never commit anywhere)
**/ghelper_sub.yaml
**/ghelper_pac.js
**/auth.json
**/auth.json.broken
**/sf_api_key
**/*.secret

# 二进制 / 安装包 / 大文件 (binaries, installers)
*.exe
*.zip
*.7z
*.dll

# 运行时 / 缓存 (runtime, caches)
**/generated_images/
**/cache.db
.workbuddy/

# 系统 / 编辑器 (OS, editor)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
